{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/c6d01c8a05967237a7dbfe827652c7f1.avif?t=1771644863\" width=964 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a magical medieval world where every step costs resources and every battle shapes your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Soul Card Duel, you control a single wanderer traveling across a hexagonal survival map. Each tile consumes food, gold is earned in missions and combat, and camps let you save, rebuild your deck, and adjust your armor. There are no character levels, your power comes entirely from your cards and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your route, manage your supplies, master your deck, and survive long enough to claim victory in the ultimate tournament.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/48f9482363cf77913d8ec1e86964b6b6.poster.avif?t=1771644863\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/48f9482363cf77913d8ec1e86964b6b6.webm?t=1771644863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/48f9482363cf77913d8ec1e86964b6b6.mp4?t=1771644863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Tactical deckbuilder with 8-direction positional combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Hex survival map with food, gold, and resource management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Character customization through cards and armor, no level grinding</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Procedural encounters with fixed world structure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Limited save system tied to survival mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Main story, side quests, and endgame roaming bosses</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE BATTLEFIELD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your cards with precision to maximize synergies, counter enemy strategies, and dominate the battlefield like a true tactical master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/252f504413594086e5c96abfea8eba52.avif?t=1771644863\" width=1500 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A DYNAMIC WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through unique biomes, discover mysterious villages, hidden treasures, and events that reshape your adventure with every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/b1323bb8640b6dfeec97d659ad0b30cc.poster.avif?t=1771644863\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/b1323bb8640b6dfeec97d659ad0b30cc.webm?t=1771644863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/b1323bb8640b6dfeec97d659ad0b30cc.mp4?t=1771644863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>EVOLVE YOUR LEGEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your hero with gear upgrades and special abilities. Every piece matters to create an unstoppable warrior, ready for any challenge.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/9a93fb178a6adaf2bee43c8315a2bf12.poster.avif?t=1771644863\" width=916 